    "detailed_description": "Explore <strong>Pocket Cars</strong>, the thrilling <strong>arcade combat-racing</strong> game! Race <strong>RC cars</strong> through dynamic tracks, tackling real-life obstacles with precision. With realistic vehicles featuring impressive off-road capabilities and high-speed boost, get ready for an exhilarating racing experience unlike any other.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/662afb1302111a47ec01c8683edeac63.webp?t=1741264780\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/6219812d003c02e26020c2ebefadfd09.poster.avif?t=1741264780\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/6219812d003c02e26020c2ebefadfd09.webm?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/6219812d003c02e26020c2ebefadfd09.mp4?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Gear up, rev your engines, and get ready to dominate the track in RC Racing!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>180+ singleplayer <strong>challenges</strong>.<br></li><li>4-player <strong>split-screen</strong> multiplayer.<br></li><li>15-player <strong>online</strong> multiplayer.</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/f018d513eaa7abf33485ce7ac0af4193.webp?t=1741264780\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/f0bf33c60cd9c7423c04249e3131b27a.poster.avif?t=1741264780\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/f0bf33c60cd9c7423c04249e3131b27a.webm?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/f0bf33c60cd9c7423c04249e3131b27a.mp4?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Choose from an arsenal of deadly weapons to outmaneuver and outgun your opponents.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>16 <strong>physics-simulated</strong> cars.<br></li><li>16 unique <strong>weapons</strong> including Rocket, Mine, EMP, and more.</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/273c72fe8a113282032877b1e6b845f3.webp?t=1741264780\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/7d72fe4eae237d0bb855455e3f1c87f6.poster.avif?t=1741264780\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/7d72fe4eae237d0bb855455e3f1c87f6.webm?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/7d72fe4eae237d0bb855455e3f1c87f6.mp4?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Adventure in the Stunt Arena, where every jump, flip, and crash earns you points!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gravity-defying <strong>stunts</strong>.<br></li><li>Seamless gameplay with <strong>controller support</strong>.</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/64cd21724b28aecb66468779603840b0.webp?t=1741264780\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/272371fc87582e2da13e5e05065309e2.poster.avif?t=1741264780\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/272371fc87582e2da13e5e05065309e2.webm?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/272371fc87582e2da13e5e05065309e2.mp4?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Unleash your creativity and personalize your RC car to reflect your unique style!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customizable <strong>paints, materials, decals</strong>, and gadgets.<br></li><li>Select wisely <strong>your tires</strong> for enhanced performance.</li></ul><br><br><i>Don\u2019t forget to wishlist and follow!</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/bad221ccae439edd4accffe220b7a6c4.poster.avif?t=1741264780\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/bad221ccae439edd4accffe220b7a6c4.webm?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1170720/extras/bad221ccae439edd4accffe220b7a6c4.mp4?t=1741264780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
